# **GPU Memory Prediction for Multimodal Model Training**

Jinwoo Jeong∗ Korea University Seoul, Republic of Korea jwjeong@os.korea.ac.kr

Changyong Shin Korea University Seoul, Republic of Korea cyshin@os.korea.ac.kr

